        "description": "Find an expression for |f(x) - f(2)|",
        "details": "|f(x) - f(2)| = |x³ - 3x + 1 - 3| = |x³ - 3x - 2| = |(x-2)(x² + 2x + 1)| = |x-2|·(x+1)²"
      },
